conclusion: "At 15 km, a 39.2% longer main battery range (26.63 km to 37.07 km with Spotting Aircraft + Gun Fire Control System Modification 2) shrinks vertical dispersion from 120.1 m to 100.6 m; horizontal is unchanged at 192 m. With sigma 2.1, half of the shells land within 31.3% of the ellipse (60.1 m by 37.6 m) and 72.4% within its inner half; a higher sigma packs more shells toward the aim point. Aiming Systems Modification 1 narrows both: horizontal 192 m to 178.6 m, vertical 120.1 m to 111.7 m."
